seg-5e2a2e8af941 = The score is only as good as the checks behind it, which look at a ship's physics and its other sensors; a self-consistent counterfeit with a matching clock is not seen by NMEA-only monitors (<a1><c1/></a1>). Absence of an alarm is not evidence of a good fix.

